<title>MALAYSIA: HOCKEY-FOUR-NATION TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>HOCKEY-FOUR-NATION TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from a Four-Nation</p>
<p>hockey tournament on Thursday:</p>
<p>    Malaysia   5    Switzerland   2   (halftime 2-1)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Malaysia - A. Arul Selvaraj (17th), Chairil Anwar Abdul Aziz</p>
<p>(28th), Apthar Singh (40th), S.Kuhan (52nd), M. Kaliswaran</p>
<p>(56th)</p>
<p>Switzerland - Stefan Bircher (2nd), Christian Cavalett</p>
<p>(36th)</p>
<p>    South Korea   5    Belgium    2  (halftime 4-1)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>South Korea - Song Seong Tae (3rd, 14th, 53rd), Kang Keon</p>
<p>Wook (4th), Hong Kyung Seub (7th)</p>
<p>Belgium - Joeri Beunen (22nd), Jean Willems (56th)</p>
</text>
